    "work": {
      "prompt": "# Independent acceptance of three original web presets\n\nRead only the frozen acceptance /workspace/A111/runs/future/versioned_preset_catalog/acceptance.json first, and freeze your own check plan before reading candidate code. Target /workspace/A111/runs/future/versioned_preset_catalog/candidate/v1/ and its candidate-lock.json; do not inspect sibling research/reports, Root tests, state or expected outputs. This is a distinct new catalog, not a rerun of any historical UI validator. It is a browser-local example, not real approval/inventory authority.\n\nActually run its three task journeys in Chromium /usr/bin/chromium with Python Playwright, at the original 1280/390/320 widths and with keyboard and reduced motion. Inspect live UI, key rendered text contrast and screenshot pixels (open screenshots). Verify persistence using real localStorage and page reload, modal cancellation/confirmation/keyboard focus, draft preservation/error retry and conflict example; retain actual browser observations, console/page errors and original sources/hashes. Verify catalog version, paired tokens, sources/reuse scope, responsive/motion/state definitions. Do not claim physical Android, screen reader or user study proof. Only a scoped loopback HTTP server is allowed; stop it on completion. No external network, business effects or delegation.\n\nWrite only the assigned worker directory. Save each original failed harness and every command/error/repair BEFORE another run. Count each failure-driven code change separately, including logging/readers/serialization; maximum TWO corrections. At the third failure stop and report blocked; do not patch or rerun beyond the limit. Do not erase outputs or reinterpret distinct failures as one round. No candidate/source edits. Return report.md/results.json and supplied final host reply, exact artifact hashes and captured preflight. Unavailable tokens/cost/provider identity/model-active-time are null. Preflight is not semantic acceptance.\n\nRead your immutable host request at /workspace/A111/runs/future/versioned_preset_catalog/independent/job/request.json. Write report/results and final reply only inside /workspace/A111/runs/future/versioned_preset_catalog/independent/worker. Use the C3 hostdraft reply helper with a separate incomplete draft and run captured check-reply before returning. Loopback to your own scoped server is explicitly allowed; no other network.\n",
